    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "sub_001_kimawari_02",
      "hash64": "2711287578B3D480",
      "text": "Vous avez trouvé un Héliatronc !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "sub_001_kimawari_03",
      "hash64": "2711297578B3D633",
      "text": "Vous avez trouvé [VAR 0x0201(0001)] Héliatronc !\\nEmmenez-les sur la Place Héliatronc.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0201",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "sub_001_kimawari_04",
      "hash64": "27112E7578B3DEB2",
      "text": "Vous avez trouvé tous les Héliatronc\\nde Cuencia !\\r\\nEmmenez-les sur la Place Héliatronc.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 49,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "sub_001_kimawari_05",
      "hash64": "27112F7578B3E065",
      "text": "[EMPTY 87]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0057"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "sub_001_keeper_01",
      "hash64": "B1C254ED006DD28A",
      "text": "Permets-moi de te féliciter une nouvelle fois\\npour ta victoire à l’Arène !\\r\\nEt je vois que ton Badge brille de mille feux !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "sub_001_keeper_02",
      "hash64": "B1C253ED006DD0D7",
      "text": "[EMPTY 87]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0057"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "sub_001_keeper_03",
      "hash64": "B1C252ED006DCF24",
      "text": "Tu t’es vraiment bien débrouillé[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]e à l’examen\\nd’Arène !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "sub_001_keeper_04",
      "hash64": "B1C251ED006DCD71",
      "text": "Mes Héliatronc sont aussi de cet avis !\\nIls étaient ravis de ta cueillette !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "sub_001_keeper_05",
      "hash64": "B1C250ED006DCBBE",
      "text": "D’ailleurs, que dirais-tu de réitérer l’expérience ?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "sub_001_keeper_06",
      "hash64": "B1C24FED006DCA0B",
      "text": "Fantastique !\\nMes Héliatronc vont être aux anges !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "sub_001_keeper_07",
      "hash64": "B1C24EED006DC858",
      "text": "Je vais de ce pas leur demander d’aller se cacher\\nen ville !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "sub_001_kimawari_06",
      "hash64": "27112C7578B3DB4C",
      "text": "Hélia ! Héliatronc !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "sub_001_keeper_09",
      "hash64": "B1C24CED006DC4F2",
      "text": "Tu as entendu ? Ils ont dit qu’ils étaient prêts !",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "sub_001_keeper_10",
      "hash64": "B1BF4FED006B9434",
      "text": "Il te reste encore [VAR 0x0201(0001)] Héliatronc à trouver\\nà Cuencia.",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
